# POC Success Criteria - One Page Summary

**Pass Requirement**: All 10 CRITICAL + ≥8 of 11 IMPORTANT

---

## CRITICAL (Must Pass All 10)

| Area | Criteria | Test | Threshold |
|------|----------|------|-----------|
| **Discovery** | Agent/Tool/Shadow detection | Deploy 5 agents + 10 tools + 3 shadow AI | 100% detected in 24h |
| **Browser** | ChatGPT/Copilot/Gemini interception | Install extensions on Chrome/Edge/Firefox | All 3 browsers working |
| **Network** | ZScaler/proxy interception | Configure proxy, test API traffic | Proxy integration working |
| **Guardrails (Runtime)** | Block adversarial attacks | 100 attacks (injection/jailbreak/toxic/code) | ≥90% blocked <500ms |
| **Guardrails (Design)** | UI policy editor | Create 5 policies without code | UI editor working |
| **DLP** | PII/PHI detection | 50 prompts with PII | ≥95% detected |
| **Metrics** | Real-time dashboard | Review during load test | Live metrics updating |
| **Logs/Traces** | Telemetry to SIEM | 1000 events to Splunk/Sentinel | 100% ingested |
| **Deployment** | 3 environments | Deploy dev/test/prod | All 3 working |
| **Isolation** | Multi-tenant separation | 2 tenants, test data access | 100% isolated |

